---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: "Solicitar Colaboración Técnica — Profesionales"
description: "Formulario para despachos de abogados, aseguradoras y administraciones públicas. Informe de viabilidad en 48 h. Ratificación en sala incluida."
lang: es
eleventyNavigation:
  key: ContactoProfesional
  notshow: true
translations:
  - lang: ca
    permalink: /ca/contacte/
  - lang: en
    permalink: /en/contact/
permalink: "/contacto/profesional/"
breadcrumb_parent:
  label: "Contacto"
  url: "/contacto/"
---
{# contacto/profesional — Formulario guiado para profesionales #}
<div itemscope itemtype="https://schema.org/Article" style="display: none;" aria-hidden="true"><meta itemprop="headline" content="{{ title }}"><meta itemprop="description" content="{{ description }}"><meta itemprop="url" content="{{ metadata.site.url }}{{ page.url }}"><div itemprop="author" itemscope itemtype="https://schema.org/Person"><meta itemprop="name" content="{{ metadata.author.name }}"></div><div itemprop="publisher" itemscope itemtype="https://schema.org/Organization"><meta itemprop="name" content="{{ metadata.company.name }}"></div></div>
{% set ui = es %}
{% set heroTitle = "Solicitar<br>colaboración técnica" %}
{% include "partials/page-hero.njk" %}

<div style="max-width: var(--container-wide); margin: 0 auto; padding: 12px var(--gutter) 0; border-top: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);"><span style="font-size: var(--fs-small, 0.8rem); color: var(--text-muted);">¿No es un profesional? </span><a href="/contacto/particular/" style="font-size: var(--fs-small, 0.8rem); color: var(--text-accent); text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px solid transparent;" onmouseenter="this.style.borderBottomColor='var(--accent)'" onmouseleave="this.style.borderBottomColor='transparent'">Cuéntenos su caso como particular →</a></div>

<section style="max-width: var(--container-wide); margin: 0 auto; padding: var(--section-y) var(--gutter);">
<div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1.3fr 1fr; gap: clamp(28px,4vw,64px); align-items: start;" class="site-two">

{# ── Formulario guiado (profesional) ── #}
<div>
<div style="border-radius: var(--radius-md); border: 1px solid var(--border-hairline); background: var(--surface-card); overflow: hidden;">

{# Header #}
<div style="padding: 18px 24px 0;">
<div style="display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 16px;">
<span style="font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: var(--fs-mono-label); letter-spacing: var(--tracking-label); text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--text-muted);">Colaboración técnica</span>
<span id="intake-b-counter" style="font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 0.7rem; letter-spacing: 0.1em; color: var(--text-faint);">§ 01 / 05</span>
</div>
<div style="height: 2px; background: var(--stone-250, #d6d3cd); margin-top: 14px; border-radius: 1px; overflow: hidden;">
<div id="intake-b-bar" style="height: 100%; width: 20%; background: var(--accent); transition: width 0.4s ease;"></div>
</div>
</div>

{# Steps container #}
<div id="intake-b-body" style="padding: 28px 24px 8px; min-height: 280px;">
</div>

{# Footer #}
<div id="intake-b-footer" style="display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 12px; padding: 14px 24px 22px; border-top: 1px solid var(--border-subtle); margin-top: 8px;">
<button id="intake-b-back" type="button" style="font-family: var(--font-sans); font-size: 0.85rem; font-weight: 500; color: var(--text-muted); background: transparent; border: none; cursor: pointer; padding: 8px 12px; visibility: hidden;">Atrás</button>
<span id="intake-b-hint" style="font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 0.7rem; letter-spacing: 0.08em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--text-faint);">Seleccione una opción</span>
</div>

</div>
</div>

{# ── Sidebar info ── #}
<div>
<div style="position: sticky; top: 92px;">
<div style="border-radius: var(--radius-md); border: 1px solid var(--border-hairline); background: var(--surface-card); overflow: hidden;">
<div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; padding: 12px 18px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-subtle); font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: var(--fs-mono-label); letter-spacing: var(--tracking-label); text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--text-muted);">Protocolo B2B</div>
<div style="padding: 22px 22px 24px;">
<div style="font-family: var(--font-serif); font-style: italic; font-size: 1.6rem; color: var(--text-accent); margin-bottom: 4px;">Viabilidad en 48 h</div>
<div style="margin-top: 14px;">
<div style="display: flex; gap: 12px; align-items: flex-start; padding: 11px 0; border-top: 1px solid var(--border-subtle); font-size: 0.9rem; color: var(--text-body); line-height: 1.5;"><span style="font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 0.7rem; color: var(--text-accent); font-weight: 600; flex-shrink: 0; padding-top: 2px;">01</span><span>Informe preliminar de viabilidad</span></div>
<div style="display: flex; gap: 12px; align-items: flex-start; padding: 11px 0; border-top: 1px solid var(--border-subtle); font-size: 0.9rem; color: var(--text-body); line-height: 1.5;"><span style="font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 0.7rem; color: var(--text-accent); font-weight: 600; flex-shrink: 0; padding-top: 2px;">02</span><span>Honorarios fijos pactados por escrito</span></div>
<div style="display: flex; gap: 12px; align-items: flex-start; padding: 11px 0; border-top: 1px solid var(--border-subtle); font-size: 0.9rem; color: var(--text-body); line-height: 1.5;"><span style="font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 0.7rem; color: var(--text-accent); font-weight: 600; flex-shrink: 0; padding-top: 2px;">03</span><span>Ratificación garantizada (LEC art. 347)</span></div>
<div style="display: flex; gap: 12px; align-items: flex-start; padding: 11px 0; border-top: 1px solid var(--border-subtle); font-size: 0.9rem; color: var(--text-body); line-height: 1.5;"><span style="font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 0.7rem; color: var(--text-accent); font-weight: 600; flex-shrink: 0; padding-top: 2px;">04</span><span>Perito judicial — Min. Justicia</span></div>
</div>

<div style="display: flex; gap: 14px; margin-top: 18px;">
<a href="tel:{{ metadata.contact.phoneNumber | replace(' ', '') }}" style="flex: 1; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; padding: 14px 16px; border-radius: var(--radius-sm); border: 1px solid var(--border-hairline); background: var(--surface-raised); text-decoration: none; font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 0.85rem; font-weight: 600; color: var(--text-strong); transition: border-color 0.3s;" onmouseenter="this.style.borderColor='var(--accent)'" onmouseleave="this.style.borderColor='var(--border-hairline)'"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="var(--accent)" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M22 16.92v3a2 2 0 0 1-2.18 2 19.79 19.79 0 0 1-8.63-3.07 19.5 19.5 0 0 1-6-6 19.79 19.79 0 0 1-3.07-8.67A2 2 0 0 1 4.11 2h3a2 2 0 0 1 2 1.72c.127.96.361 1.903.7 2.81a2 2 0 0 1-.45 2.11L8.09 9.91a16 16 0 0 0 6 6l1.27-1.27a2 2 0 0 1 2.11-.45c.907.339 1.85.573 2.81.7A2 2 0 0 1 22 16.92z"/></svg>{{ metadata.contact.phoneNumber | replace('+34 ', '') }}</a>
<a href="mailto:{{ metadata.company.email }}" style="flex: 1; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; padding: 14px 16px; border-radius: var(--radius-sm); border: 1px solid var(--border-hairline); background: var(--surface-raised); text-decoration: none; font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 0.78rem; font-weight: 600; color: var(--text-strong); transition: border-color 0.3s;" onmouseenter="this.style.borderColor='var(--accent)'" onmouseleave="this.style.borderColor='var(--border-hairline)'"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="var(--accent)" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M4 4h16c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2v12c0 1.1-.9 2-2 2H4c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V6c0-1.1.9-2 2-2z"/><polyline points="22,6 12,13 2,6"/></svg>Email</a>
</div>

<div style="margin-top: 12px; text-align: center; font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 0.65rem; letter-spacing: 0.1em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--text-faint);">Confidencial · Sin compromiso</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>

</div>
</section>

<script>
(function(){
  'use strict';
  var STEPS = [
    { key: 'entidad', eyebrow: '§ 01 · Su entidad', type: 'choice',
      question: '¿Desde qué tipo de organización nos contacta?',
      options: ['Despacho de abogados', 'Aseguradora o reaseguradora', 'Administración pública', 'Empresa constructora o promotora', 'Otra entidad'] },
    { key: 'encargo', eyebrow: '§ 02 · Tipo de encargo', type: 'choice',
      question: '¿Qué tipo de actuación pericial necesita?',
      helper: 'Si no está seguro, seleccione la opción más cercana.',
      options: ['Informe pericial de parte', 'Actuación como perito judicial', 'Contrainforme pericial', 'Valoración de siniestro', 'Asesoramiento técnico / due diligence'] },
    { key: 'importe', eyebrow: '§ 03 · Cuantía', type: 'choice',
      question: '¿Cuál es el importe aproximado en disputa?',
      helper: 'Nos permite dimensionar el alcance del dictamen.',
      options: ['Menos de 100.000 €', 'Entre 100.000 € y 500.000 €', 'Entre 500.000 € y 1.000.000 €', 'Más de 1.000.000 €', 'No definido todavía'] },
    { key: 'procesal', eyebrow: '§ 04 · Situación procesal', type: 'choice',
      question: '¿En qué fase se encuentra el asunto?',
      options: ['Pre-litigio / negociación', 'Litigio activo (demanda interpuesta)', 'Mediación o arbitraje', 'Gestión de siniestro', 'Consulta preliminar'] },
    { key: 'contacto', eyebrow: '§ 05 · Datos de contacto', type: 'fields',
      question: '¿Cómo le contactamos?',
      helper: 'Informe de viabilidad en 48 h. Interlocución directa con el perito.',
      fields: [
        { name: 'nombre', label: 'Nombre completo', placeholder: 'Nombre y apellidos', required: true },
        { name: 'entidad_nombre', label: 'Entidad', placeholder: 'Nombre del despacho o empresa', required: true },
        { name: 'cargo', label: 'Cargo', placeholder: 'Socio / Director / Letrado', required: false },
        { name: 'email', label: 'Correo electrónico profesional', type: 'email', placeholder: 'nombre@despacho.com', required: true },
        { name: 'telefono', label: 'Teléfono directo', type: 'tel', placeholder: '+34 ___ ___ ___', required: true },
        { name: 'descripcion', label: 'Descripción breve del asunto', multiline: true, rows: 3, placeholder: 'Tipo de patología, ubicación, urgencia…', required: false }
      ] }
  ];
  var TOTAL = STEPS.length, current = 0, answers = {}, done = false;

  function pad(n){ return String(n).length < 2 ? '0'+n : String(n); }

  function render(){
    var body = document.getElementById('intake-b-body');
    var bar = document.getElementById('intake-b-bar');
    var counter = document.getElementById('intake-b-counter');
    var backBtn = document.getElementById('intake-b-back');
    var hint = document.getElementById('intake-b-hint');
    var footer = document.getElementById('intake-b-footer');
    if(!body) return;
    body.innerHTML = '';
    var pct = done ? 100 : Math.round(((current+1)/TOTAL)*100);
    bar.style.width = pct+'%';
    counter.textContent = '§ '+pad(done?TOTAL:current+1)+' / '+pad(TOTAL);
    backBtn.style.visibility = current===0 ? 'hidden' : 'visible';

    if(done){
      footer.style.display = 'none';
      body.innerHTML = '<div style="text-align:center;padding:14px 0 24px;">'+
        '<div style="width:48px;height:48px;border-radius:50%;margin:0 auto;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;background:var(--positive-tint,#e8f5e9);color:var(--positive,#2e7d32);font-size:22px;font-weight:600;">✓</div>'+
        '<h3 style="font-family:var(--font-serif);font-size:var(--fs-h2,1.75rem);font-weight:400;margin:20px 0 0;color:var(--text-strong);">Solicitud recibida</h3>'+
        '<p style="margin:12px auto 0;max-width:40ch;color:var(--text-muted);line-height:1.55;">Hemos registrado su consulta. Le responderemos en 24 h laborables con un informe preliminar de viabilidad.</p>'+
        '</div>';
      return;
    }

    var step = STEPS[current];
    var html = '';
    if(step.eyebrow) html += '<div style="font-family:var(--font-mono);font-size:var(--fs-mono-label,0.6875rem);letter-spacing:var(--tracking-label,0.14em);text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--text-accent);margin-bottom:12px;">'+step.eyebrow+'</div>';
    html += '<h3 style="font-family:var(--font-serif);font-size:var(--fs-h2,1.75rem);font-weight:400;line-height:1.2;color:var(--text-strong);margin:0;">'+step.question+'</h3>';
    if(step.helper) html += '<p style="margin:12px 0 0;color:var(--text-muted);font-size:0.95rem;line-height:1.55;">'+step.helper+'</p>';

    if(step.type==='choice'){
      hint.textContent = 'Seleccione una opción';
      html += '<div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:10px;margin-top:22px;">';
      step.options.forEach(function(opt,k){
        var letter = String.fromCharCode(65+k);
        var sel = answers[step.key]===opt;
        html += '<button type="button" data-choice="'+k+'" style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:14px;width:100%;text-align:left;padding:14px 16px;cursor:pointer;font-family:inherit;font-size:inherit;background:'+(sel?'var(--accent-tint)':'var(--surface-raised,#fff)')+';border:1.5px solid;border-color:'+(sel?'var(--accent)':'var(--border-hairline)')+';border-radius:var(--radius-sm);transition:background 0.15s ease,border-color 0.15s ease;">'+
          '<span style="width:24px;height:24px;flex-shrink:0;border-radius:var(--radius-xs);border:1px solid;border-color:'+(sel?'var(--accent)':'var(--border-hairline)')+';background:'+(sel?'var(--accent)':'transparent')+';color:'+(sel?'var(--bone-100)':'var(--text-muted)')+';display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-family:var(--font-mono);font-size:0.7rem;font-weight:600;">'+letter+'</span>'+
          '<span style="font-family:var(--font-sans);font-size:0.975rem;color:var(--text-strong);">'+opt+'</span>'+
          '</button>';
      });
      html += '</div>';
    }

    if(step.type==='fields'){
      hint.textContent = '';
      hint.innerHTML = '<button type="button" id="intake-b-submit" style="font-family:var(--font-sans);font-size:0.9rem;font-weight:600;color:var(--accent-on,#fff);background:var(--accent);border:1.5px solid transparent;border-radius:var(--radius-sm);padding:10px 20px;cursor:pointer;line-height:1;letter-spacing:0.005em;">Enviar solicitud</button>';
      html += '<div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:16px;margin-top:22px;">';
      step.fields.forEach(function(f){
        var val = (answers[step.key]&&answers[step.key][f.name]) || '';
        html += '<div><label for="ib-'+f.name+'" style="display:block;font-family:var(--font-sans);font-size:0.85rem;font-weight:500;color:var(--text-strong);margin-bottom:6px;">'+f.label+(f.required?'':'<span style="color:var(--text-faint);font-weight:400;margin-left:6px;">(opcional)</span>')+'</label>';
        if(f.multiline){
          html += '<textarea id="ib-'+f.name+'" name="'+f.name+'" rows="'+(f.rows||3)+'" placeholder="'+(f.placeholder||'')+'" '+(f.required?'required':'')+' style="width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;font-family:var(--font-sans);font-size:0.95rem;padding:12px 14px;border:1.5px solid var(--border-hairline);border-radius:var(--radius-sm);background:var(--surface-raised,#fff);color:var(--text-strong);resize:vertical;outline:none;">'+val+'</textarea>';
        } else {
          html += '<input id="ib-'+f.name+'" type="'+(f.type||'text')+'" name="'+f.name+'" placeholder="'+(f.placeholder||'')+'" value="'+val+'" '+(f.required?'required':'')+' style="width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;font-family:var(--font-sans);font-size:0.95rem;padding:12px 14px;border:1.5px solid var(--border-hairline);border-radius:var(--radius-sm);background:var(--surface-raised,#fff);color:var(--text-strong);outline:none;">';
        }
        html += '</div>';
      });
      html += '</div>';
    }

    body.innerHTML = html;

    body.querySelectorAll('[data-choice]').forEach(function(btn){
      btn.addEventListener('click', function(){
        var idx = parseInt(btn.getAttribute('data-choice'));
        answers[step.key] = step.options[idx];
        setTimeout(function(){ if(current<TOTAL-1){current++;render();} }, 240);
        render();
      });
    });

    body.querySelectorAll('input,textarea').forEach(function(inp){
      inp.addEventListener('input', function(){
        if(!answers[step.key]) answers[step.key]={};
        answers[step.key][inp.name] = inp.value;
      });
      inp.addEventListener('focus', function(){ inp.style.borderColor='var(--accent)'; });
      inp.addEventListener('blur', function(){ inp.style.borderColor='var(--border-hairline)'; });
    });

    var submitBtn = document.getElementById('intake-b-submit');
    if(submitBtn){
      submitBtn.addEventListener('click', function(){
        var contactData = answers.contacto || {};
        var valid = step.fields.every(function(f){
          if(!f.required) return true;
          var v = contactData[f.name];
          return v && v.trim().length > 0;
        });
        if(!valid){ alert('Por favor, complete los campos obligatorios.'); return; }
        submitForm();
      });
    }
  }

  function submitForm(){
    var contactData = answers.contacto || {};
    var payload = {
      tipo_cliente: 'profesional',
      nombre: contactData.nombre || '',
      entidad_nombre: contactData.entidad_nombre || '',
      cargo: contactData.cargo || '',
      email: contactData.email || '',
      telefono: contactData.telefono || '',
      descripcion: contactData.descripcion || '',
      entidad: answers.entidad || '',
      encargo: answers.encargo || '',
      importe: answers.importe || '',
      procesal: answers.procesal || '',
      lang: 'es',
      timestamp: new Date().toISOString(),
      source: 'perito.barcelona'
    };
    /* Show sending state */
    var body = document.getElementById('intake-b-body');
    if(body) body.innerHTML = '<div style="text-align:center;padding:40px 0;"><div style="width:36px;height:36px;border:3px solid var(--border-hairline);border-top-color:var(--accent);border-radius:50%;margin:0 auto;animation:spin 0.8s linear infinite;"></div><p style="margin:16px 0 0;color:var(--text-muted);font-size:0.95rem;">Enviando…</p></div><style>@keyframes spin{to{transform:rotate(360deg)}}</style>';
    document.getElementById('intake-b-footer').style.display='none';
    var ctrl = new AbortController();
    var timer = setTimeout(function(){ ctrl.abort(); }, 10000);
    fetch('/api/contacto', {
      method: 'POST',
      headers: { 'Content-Type': 'application/json' },
      body: JSON.stringify(payload),
      signal: ctrl.signal
    }).then(function(res){
      clearTimeout(timer);
      if(!res.ok) throw new Error('HTTP ' + res.status);
      done = true; render();
      setTimeout(function(){ window.location.href='/gracias/'; }, 2500);
    }).catch(function(){
      clearTimeout(timer);
      var subject = encodeURIComponent('Consulta web — Profesional');
      var bodyParts = 'No se pudo enviar el formulario. Datos:\n\n' +
        'Nombre: ' + (contactData.nombre||'') + '\nEntidad: ' + (contactData.entidad_nombre||'') +
        '\nCargo: ' + (contactData.cargo||'') + '\nEmail: ' + (contactData.email||'') +
        '\nTeléfono: ' + (contactData.telefono||'') + '\nEntidad tipo: ' + (answers.entidad||'') +
        '\nEncargo: ' + (answers.encargo||'') + '\nImporte: ' + (answers.importe||'') +
        '\nSituación procesal: ' + (answers.procesal||'') +
        '\n\nDescripción:\n' + (contactData.descripcion||'');
      var mailto = 'mailto:info@perito.barcelona?subject=' + subject + '&body=' + encodeURIComponent(bodyParts);
      if(body) body.innerHTML =
        '<style>@keyframes errorSlideIn{from{opacity:0;transform:translateY(12px)}to{opacity:1;transform:translateY(0)}}@keyframes errorPulse{0%,100%{transform:scale(1)}50%{transform:scale(1.08)}}</style>' +
        '<div style="padding:20px 0;animation:errorSlideIn 0.4s ease-out;">' +
          '<div style="text-align:center;margin-bottom:24px;">' +
            '<div style="width:52px;height:52px;border-radius:50%;margin:0 auto;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;background:rgba(220,53,69,0.1);animation:errorPulse 1.5s ease-in-out 1;">' +
              '<svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#dc3545" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><line x1="12" y1="8" x2="12" y2="12"/><line x1="12" y1="16" x2="12.01" y2="16"/></svg>' +
            '</div>' +
            '<h3 style="font-family:var(--font-serif);font-size:var(--fs-h2,1.75rem);font-weight:400;margin:16px 0 0;color:var(--text-strong);">No se ha podido enviar</h3>' +
            '<p style="margin:8px auto 0;max-width:38ch;color:var(--text-muted);font-size:0.9rem;line-height:1.55;">Sus datos están guardados. Use una de estas opciones para contactarnos directamente:</p>' +
          '</div>' +
          '<div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:10px;">' +
            '<a href="' + mailto + '" style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;padding:14px 18px;border-radius:var(--radius-sm);border:1.5px solid var(--accent);background:var(--accent);text-decoration:none;transition:opacity 0.2s;" onmouseenter="this.style.opacity=\'0.9\'" onmouseleave="this.style.opacity=\'1\'">' +
              '<svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="var(--accent-on,#fff)" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M4 4h16c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2v12c0 1.1-.9 2-2 2H4c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V6c0-1.1.9-2 2-2z"/><polyline points="22,6 12,13 2,6"/></svg>' +
              '<span style="flex:1;"><span style="display:block;font-family:var(--font-sans);font-size:0.9rem;font-weight:600;color:var(--accent-on,#fff);">Abrir email con sus datos</span><span style="display:block;font-family:var(--font-mono);font-size:0.7rem;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.7);margin-top:2px;">info@perito.barcelona</span></span>' +
              '<svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="rgba(255,255,255,0.6)" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polyline points="9 18 15 12 9 6"/></svg>' +
            '</a>' +
